            "Path to the preprocessed JSONL file containing training data with audio codes.": "預處理後的 JSONL 檔案路徑，其中需包含帶音訊碼的訓練資料。",
            "Base model to fine-tune. Must be a 'Base' model variant.": "用於微調的基礎模型，必須為 Base 變體。",
