            "Number of training epochs to run.": "訓練的總輪數。",
            "Number of samples per batch. Lower values use less VRAM.": "每批樣本數量，數值越小顯存佔用越低。",
            "Learning rate. Qwen default (2e-5) is too aggressive for small batches, causing noise output. Defaults to 2e-6 for stability.": "學習率。Qwen 預設值 (2e-5) 對小批量過於激進，會導致雜訊輸出；預設為 2e-6 以保證穩定。",
            "Name for the custom speaker. Use this name when generating with the fine-tuned model.": "自訂說話人名稱，使用微調模型生成語音時透過該名稱指定音色。",
            "Random seed for reproducibility.": "隨機種子，用於結果重現。",
            "Continue training from the latest checkpoint in output_dir.": "從輸出目錄中最新的檢查點繼續訓練。",
            "Log training progress every N steps.": "每 N 步記錄一次訓練日誌。",
            "Save checkpoint every N epochs. Set to 0 to only save final epoch. Ignored if save_every_steps > 0.": "每 N 輪儲存一次檢查點，設為 0 則僅在最終輪儲存；當按步儲存（save_every_steps > 0）時此項被忽略。",
            "Save checkpoint every N steps. Set to 0 to use epoch-based saving instead.": "每 N 步儲存一次檢查點，設為 0 則改為按輪儲存。",
            "bf16 recommended. Use fp32 only if GPU doesn't support bf16 (pre-Ampere).": "建議使用 bf16；僅當顯示卡不支援 bf16（安培架構之前）時改用 fp32。",
            "Accumulate gradients over N steps before updating. Effective batch size = batch_size * gradient_accumulation.": "更新參數前累積 N 步梯度，等效批次大小 = 批次大小 × 梯度累積步數。",
            "Trade compute for VRAM by recomputing activations. Saves ~30-40% VRAM.": "透過重算激活值以計算時間換取顯存，可節省約 30-40% 顯存。",
            "Use 8-bit AdamW optimizer. Saves ~50% optimizer VRAM. Requires bitsandbytes.": "使用 8 位元 AdamW 優化器，可節省約 50% 優化器顯存，需安裝 bitsandbytes。",
            "L2 regularization strength to prevent overfitting.": "L2 正規化強度，用於防止過擬合。",
            "Gradient clipping threshold to prevent exploding gradients.": "梯度裁剪閾值，用於防止梯度爆炸。",
            "Number of warmup steps. Set to 0 to disable warmup. Recommended: 5-10% of total steps.": "預熱步數，設為 0 關閉預熱；建議設為總步數的 5-10%。",
            "Warmup as ratio of total steps. Ignored if warmup_steps > 0. E.g., 0.1 = 10% warmup.": "依總步數比例預熱，當 warmup_steps > 0 時此項目會被忽略，例如 0.1 表示預熱 10%。",
            "Save optimizer/scheduler state in checkpoints. Enables perfect resume but doubles checkpoint size.": "在檢查點中儲存優化器/排程器狀態，可完美恢復訓練，但檢查點體積約增加一倍。"
